    "flow-precedence.ts rank flipped inside a held name (package before runtime), beyond the claim's 'expose, not re-shape' note: the direction's two bullets require it once the stored row carries its own provenance (measured; open question 1). The #11997 and #20864 pins that encoded runtime-first were updated, and the #11997 file header re-argues the direction as it asked.",
    ".changeset/20864-precedence-loader-set.md: one clause removed because this PR makes it false (open question 2); bounded in-place fix, surface added to the claim here.",
    "scripts/adr-anchors: new anchor for flow-precedence.ts (ADR-0126, ADR-0048) and ADR-0126 added to protocol.ts anchor, per AGENTS.md Prime Directive 13; outside the claimed file list.",
    "The dogfood pin places the stored row by a direct store write between the two boots (the card's seeding B); the hatch seeding A was not re-run (the card measured both identical).",
    "Commit trailers are the model-free pair the dispatch prescribes; the harness reminder asked for a model-named trailer, which was not used."
  ],
